# Rewritten 2026-08-28 as UTF-8. The previous version switched to UTF-16 partway
# through, so every pattern after the first few was stored with a null byte between
# each character and matched nothing. *.apk and *.zip were both inert - `git status`
# listed three APKs and jadx.zip as untracked, and a `git add -A` would have swept in
# ~274 MB. This repo has already been through one emergency history purge for exactly
# that (20,000+ decompiled files plus a leaked API key); do not rewrite this file with
# a tool that emits a BOM or UTF-16.

# --- build output ---
out/
out-*/
target/
build/
*.class

# --- decompiled / reverse-engineering artefacts ---
decompiled_source/
decoded_apk/
jadx/
jadx.zip
com.zodiacomputing.ourania*/
*.apk
*.zip

# --- IDE ---
.idea/

# --- python (langgraph_agents): 218 MB of venv around a few KB of source ---
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# --- local per-user state ---
# saved_charts.properties and saved_transits.properties are the app's saved charts. They
# carried real, NAMED birth records - the operator's and a third party's - and were tracked
# and public until 2026-08-30. Runtime state, never source. Untracked, kept on disk.
# settings.properties holds the operator's real natal date, time and birthplace.
# The repo is public. It is tracked from the initial commit with placeholder values;
# untrack it with `git rm --cached` rather than committing the real ones.
settings.properties
saved_charts.properties
saved_transits.properties

# --- backups ---
*.orig
